#############################################
# ADDED 2026-07-15 — surfaced by a direct WebFetch of Gaya Herrington's
# own bio site (gayaherrington.com/about), prompted by MJSullivan's own
# push to look harder for independently-verifiable resources beyond the
# original podcast-intro-driven bootstrap. Post-Carbon Institute is
# especially notable: it's an ALREADY-MODELED Organization in this graph
# (tgs:Organization.PostCarbonInstitute), and Nate Hagens himself sits on
# its Board too (tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_PostCarbonInstitute) — a
# genuine, real cross-connection between two bootstrapped guests, not
